{
  "$comment": "Sector-aware contact targeting for discovery (Feature 2). ALLOWLIST semantics: discovery searches ONLY the titles in the active priority list — no blocklist needed; litigation chairs / practice-group leaders / extra partners are never searched because they are not listed. Config-driven so other sectors get their own lists without code changes.",
  "contact_targets": {
    "legal": {
      "detect_sector": "legal",
      "detect_name_strong": ["LLP", "PLLC", "Attorneys at Law", "Law Firm", "Law Offices", "Law Group", "Law Office"],
      "detect_name_weak": ["& Associates", "Group", "Partners"],
      "detect_industry_keywords": ["law practice", "legal services", "legal"],
      "on_uncertain": "generic",
      "broad_search": true,
      "size_small_max": 50,
      "unknown_size": "union",
      "priority_small": [
        "Managing Partner",
        "Founder|Named Partner",
        "Firm Administrator",
        "HR Manager"
      ],
      "priority_large": [
        "HR Director",
        "Recruiting Director",
        "Legal Recruiting Manager",
        "Firm Administrator",
        "Executive Director",
        "Office Managing Partner"
      ],
      "empty_fallback": ["Owner", "Principal", "President", "Founder"]
    },
    "default": {
      "size_small_max": 50,
      "unknown_size": "union",
      "priority_small": [
        "Owner|CEO|Founder",
        "President",
        "General Manager",
        "Office Manager|Practice Manager",
        "HR Manager"
      ],
      "priority_large": [
        "HR Director|Director of Human Resources",
        "Head of HR|Head of People|Chief People Officer|CHRO",
        "VP People|VP Human Resources",
        "Head of Talent",
        "Operations Manager"
      ],
      "empty_fallback": ["Owner", "Principal", "President"]
    }
  },
  "discovery": {
    "max_candidates": 8,
    "search_per_page": 10
  },
  "$verticals_comment": "Company-first discovery (Feature 3). Each vertical drives FOUR things: the Apollo organization-search filters (keyword tags + employee range), the vertical-aware ICP employee band, the single decision-maker title priority used when the operator approves enrichment, and the `verify` block below. contact_sector links a vertical to an existing contact_targets entry so legal keeps its firm-specific ranking.",
  "$verticals_verify_comment": "Apollo's q_organization_keyword_tags matches the company's own keyword list, which includes who a company SELLS TO — a marketing agency that serves law firms carries legal keywords. So the search vertical is never proof of what a company is. `verify` decides what the review queue is allowed to ASSERT: industry_any / name_any confirm the vertical, industry_not / name_not contradict it, and anything else stays honestly unverified ('found via <vertical> search'). name patterns match on whole words only, so 'law' never fires on 'Lawson'.",
